    },
    {
      "id": "257:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“是谁？”你喊道。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58826:58837"
    },
    {
      "id": "257:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "屋外的男人无言地尖啸着。他更暴戾地撞着门。铰链开始扭曲，门锁开始变形。他随时都会闯进来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58837:58883"
    },
    {
      "id": "257:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要躲起来，转到 239。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58883:58897"
    },
    {
      "id": "257:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要寻找防身的武器，转到 241。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58897:58915"
    },
    {
      "id": "257:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要顶住屋门，转到 237。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58915:58930"
    }
  ]
}
